# Cursor Debug structured ingest (Obsidian plugin)

**This project already has a permanent Wi‑Fi → Cursor Debug ingest pipeline.** When the user asks to debug on iPad/mobile, watch live logs, or set up ingest, follow this rule and `/debug-ingest` — do not invent a parallel logging channel.

Use this rule when **debugging an Obsidian plugin on mobile**, **desktop**, or any target where a **Cursor Debug** agent session is active and you need **runtime evidence**.

## Preferred logging method

**Use the permanent gated log path + structured NDJSON ingest** — not ad-hoc `fetch`, not `console.log` alone.

| Do | Don't |
|----|--------|
| `main.log()` / `postCursorDebugIngest()` via Obsidian **`requestUrl`** | `fetch('http://127.0.0.1:7662/…')` inside the plugin |
| Runtime **device-local** Host / Port / Session ID / Ingest path (Settings → Troubleshooting) | Bake session id into the build as the primary workflow |
| Read `.cursor/debug-<sessionId>.log` on the host after reproduction | Guess fixes from code alone |
| Gate on **Debug logging** — when off, `log()` must no-op | Leave ingest POSTs running when logging is disabled |

**Mobile + Wi‑Fi:** run `bash scripts/ingest-lan-relay.sh` (socat). Print pasteable host/port with `bash scripts/print-debug-ingest-settings.sh`. See `docs/cursor-debug-ingest.md`.

**Android + USB:** use **`adb reverse tcp:<ingest-port> tcp:<ingest-port>`** when a project USB bootstrap script exists; iOS has no adb reverse — use LAN relay.

**Agent command:** `/debug-ingest` (`.cursor/commands/debug-ingest.md`).

## Deploy while debugging — agent must remind

| Path | Includes uncommitted instrumentation? |
|------|----------------------------------------|
| Copy local **`dist/`** to device vault | **Yes** |
| CI / tagged release build | **No** — builds **committed** code at the tag only |

**Before asking the user to reproduce via a release build:** remind them to **commit + push** and wait for CI — **or** copy local **`dist/`** after **`bun run build`**.

## Agent duties

1. Confirm ingest relay (LAN) or **`adb reverse`** (USB) as appropriate.
2. Ensure **Debug logging** is on and device-local ingest fields match the active Debug session (path UUID ≠ session slug).
3. **Remind deploy path** (local `dist/` copy vs release + commit).
4. Clear **only** the session log file (`.cursor/debug-<sessionId>.log`) before each reproduction run.
5. Prefer **Send test log** in settings to verify the pipeline before diagnosing the real bug.
6. Read the log file after reproduction; cite line evidence before fixing.

Remove temporary ad-hoc ingest call sites after verified fix. Keep `src/debug/cursor-debug-ingest.ts` and the gated `main.log()` integration.
